  "overview": "Corazón Guerrero is a Mexican telenovela produced by Salvador Mejía Alejandre for TelevisaUnivision and originally broadcast on Las Estrellas from March 28 to November 11, 2022. It is based on the Argentine telenovela Valientes (2009), created by Marcos Carnevale and Lily Ann Martin. Adapted by Katia Rodríguez Estrada, the telenovela was directed by Víctor Rodríguez and Carlos Santos. It stars Alejandra Espinoza, Gonzalo García Vivanco, Rodrigo Guirao, Christian de la Campa, Ana Martín, Sabine Moussier, Diego Olivera, and Altaír Jarabo.\n\nThe story follows the Sánchez brothers—Jesús, Damián, and Samuel—who reunite to seek justice against Augusto Ruíz Montalvo, the powerful man responsible for destroying their family years earlier. While carrying out their plan for revenge, each brother falls in love, forcing them to choose between hatred and forgiveness. As hidden truths come to light, they must confront betrayal, family secrets, and the consequences of the past.",
